;
; How Lifeboat files one recovery check in MYRA (lifeboat_rules.h LB6): its
; number, the repair step it named (0 none .. 4), the journal, books and
; backup results (0 or 1), the room above the floor in bytes (below 1 at or
; under it) and when it ran (ms since 1970, zxvd's clock).
^ZXLIFEBOAT(seq:i9) = step:i1! ^ journal:i1! ^ books:i1! ^ tested:i1! ^ room:i18! ^ stamp:i15!
